            <div xml:id="d194-a1">

                <pb facs="0463" n="339" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg339"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 228.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Law</hi> 19 <hi rendition="#small-caps">of</hi>
                    1880. (<hi rendition="#small-caps">May</hi> 8.)</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">upon public order.</hi></p>
                <p>The Congress of the United States of Colombia decrees:</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sole Article</hi>. The national government secures to
                    each of the states of the union a republican form of government, in the terms
                    established in the federal constitution, and will restrain every attempt at
                    invasion of any one of them, as well as all domestic violence against the
                    government of whatever state, it being always understood that in the latter case
                    the intervention of the national government be requested by the state
                    legislature, or in the recess thereof by the state executive power.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Given at <placeName>Bogotá</placeName> on
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1880-05-07">the seventh of May, one
                            thousand eight hundred and eighty</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/> The President of the Senate of plenipotentiaries:<lb/><signed>CÁRLOS ICAZA
                        AROSEMENA.</signed><lb/>The President of the Chamber of
                        Representatives:<lb/><signed>OCTAVIO SALAZAR.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Let it be published and executed.</p>
                    <p>The President of the Union:</p>
                    <closer><signed>RAFAEL NUÑEZ.</signed></closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
